  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency humanitarian assistance to the population affected by war</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The team of Ya Kherzon made a decision to meet the needs of vulnerable groups. Currently, more than 1000 people who need hygiene products for care have already applied to our foundation. Ya Kherson was able to create a database with a segregation of personal data of people in need such as age, gender, location and type of vulnerability.  Funding is needed to purchase emergency humanitarian aid in the form of hygiene for the care of bedridden and disabled people. This will support people in hygiene products and allow for more in-depth research and collection of information on other real needs (water, food, psychological, legal).</narrative>
  </description>
